stat - show file metadata

SYNOPSIS
    stat file ...

DESCRIPTION
    Print the type, size in bytes, inode number, link count, filesystem
    device number, numeric owner and group IDs, and octal mode of each file.

EXIT STATUS
    The exit status is 0 on success or 1 on error.

SEE ALSO
    ls(1), statx(2)
